## GitHub Linguist Overrides - Force 100% C# Language Bar Recognition
*.xaml linguist-detectable=false
*.ps1 linguist-vendored=true
*.py linguist-vendored=true
*.sh linguist-vendored=true
*.yml linguist-vendored=true
*.md linguist-documentation=true

